    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned the demographics in District 2 and 4 might play a role in the spread. When you look at the \"communal living\" in River Point or the density in Eastside, are you seeing specific cultural or behavioral patterns in those groups that would drive the transmission rate higher compared to somewhere like Oak Ridge?",
